# Folder library

Canonical: [`.cursor/saved/folder-library/BRIEF.md`](../saved/folder-library/BRIEF.md)  
Format badges: [`.cursor/saved/folder-library/FileCard.original.tsx`](../saved/folder-library/FileCard.original.tsx)

## Product

- **`[+]` menu (folder):** Skills/PDF · Image · Video (not blind create into current tab).
- **`[+]` menu (document):** Skills/PDF · Image.
- **Tabs:** All · Images · Videos · AI skills (Videos hidden on document owner).
- **Image:** tag + TXT-Placeholder + WebP; detail switch + copy + download; **wallColor** on preview pane.
- **Video:** tag + TXT-Placeholder + mp4/webm/mov ≤2 min · ≤100 MB; detail switch + play + download; same **wallColor**. Folder only.
- **Skill:** tag + “qué hace?” + attachment; open → Download.
- **Document sub-library:** fichas on the node; folder overlay **Folder | Docs** toggle only if a child doc has fichas (subfolder per doc).
- Bytes → `doc-images`. Metadatos → `campaigns.library_items` (folder) · `nodes.library_items` (document).

